# Bridal Team — environment variables
#
# The AI planner works out of the box in "demo mode" (smart, rule-based replies).
# To power it with live Claude AI, add your Anthropic API key below.

# Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com/
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional: override the model (defaults to claude-sonnet-5)
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5
